    ))}
  </section>

  <section class="qa-sources qa-section" aria-labelledby="src-h2">
    <h2 id="src-h2">Sources</h2>
    <ol class="qa-src-list">
      <li id="src-1">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). In <em>Birds of the World</em>. Cornell Lab. — diet overview.</li>
      <li id="src-2">Heinrich, B. (1989). <em>Ravens in Winter</em>. Simon & Schuster. — wolf–raven relationships and carrion foraging.</li>
      <li id="src-3">Bugnyar, T. & Heinrich, B. (2005). Ravens differentiate between knowledgeable and ignorant competitors. <em>Proceedings of the Royal Society B</em> 272, pp. 1641–46. — food caching and cache protection.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="qa-claim-note"><strong class="claim-science">[science]</strong> peer-reviewed study or field-guide data</p>
  </section>

